	•	Section 3 Comments/Quotes: The paper’s main proposed model is the “multi-layer perceptron algorithm,” and it also implemented “the Radial Basis Function Network model to prove the accuracy of proposed model.” Inputs were donor, recipient, and transplantation tabular variables selected from UNOS using InfoGain Attribute Eval with ranker search. The comparison was against an earlier published computational system rather than a clinical guideline or human reader. The paper discusses “validation” but the retrieved text does not clearly describe a standard split or CV protocol, so I classify validation as Other rather than guessing. No SHAP/LIME-style interpretability or explicit hyperparameter tuning was reported.

